    <cmt>description: *Special rate for cyclists, &lt;br&gt;(Quebec National Park) &lt;br&gt;"Sépaq is proud to partner with Vélo Québec to establish a Welcome Cyclists campsite network. Enjoy campsites exclusively for touring cyclists. They’re easily accessible and available without advance booking.&lt;br&gt;Le Plateau campground&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; 2 campsites&lt;br&gt; 2 fire pits&lt;br&gt; 2 tables&lt;br&gt; Bike racks&lt;br&gt; Water access point: 200 m&lt;br&gt; La Carapace Visitors Centre nearby (community room - shelter, washroom, store and convenience store)&lt;br&gt; Lockers for food&lt;br&gt; Possibility of access via a cycling path&lt;br&gt; Sunny campsites&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Information: 819 427-5350&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Period: from the end of April to mid-October"&lt;br&gt;https://www.sepaq.com/pq/pla/index.dot#Item198c7371-83d3-43ca-aa9c-62cc5314304d&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Type: Approved Accommodation (campground)&lt;br&gt;ID:</cmt>
