    <name>Highbury Gardens RV Park2</name>
    <cmt>description: Features&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Enjoy the clean, fresh air and outdoor lifestyle, without giving up all the comforts of home.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer our campers:18-web&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;RV Sites&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; Full Hook-Up (20, 30, and 50 Amp) 3 Way, 2 Way and unserviced sites&lt;br&gt; Pull-Thru Sites (Depending on availability)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Tenting Areas&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; Unserviced Sites&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Note: Both wooded and open camping sites are available. Each site includes a picnic table and a fire pit.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; Carded Electronic Security Gate&lt;br&gt; Function Room&lt;br&gt; Modern Washrooms&lt;br&gt; Games Room&lt;br&gt; Laundry Facilities&lt;br&gt; Swimming Pool&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; Convenience Store&lt;br&gt; Pets Permitted (on a leash)&lt;br&gt; Nature Trails&lt;br&gt; Quiet Hours (11 pm to 8 am)&lt;br&gt; Special Events&lt;br&gt; Friendly Atmosphere&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;https://highburygardens.com/features/&lt;br&gt;Type: Privately Owned Campground&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;ID:</cmt>
